From c203ab13066e8ef4528c7e2aed43f01efd677f2a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 02:58:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] API 42: players.open-radial-menu (a mod's mode selector on
 one player's screen)

The entries are drawn around the screen's centre with the current one marked, the pointer is let go, a click or a tap on an entry chooses it (the middle or Escape closes the menu), and the choice goes back to the mod as a message on <mod id>:radial.

